WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,150
what are you doing

2
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:03,440
Captain Han

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,880
Thank you for saving all of us at Galaxy Base

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,680
You provided us with supplies and assistance for half a year

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,080
Saved us again today

6
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,080
You are the benefactor of our entire base

7
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,960
Okay, let’s all eat, Captain Han.

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,360
I am not the director of this base.

9
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,480
I want to make the entire galaxy base

10
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,440
Let's all sneak into your base and take us in.

11
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,080
I'll be at your disposal from now on

12
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:29,780
How many of you are there now, plus ninety-five of me?

13
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,980
who are there

14
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:34,660
Forty-five wives, children, 17 elderly persons, 33 men

15
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:35,820
Seven people with cheap power

16
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:36,820
Three people with cheap speed

17
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,420
I am the only person with abilities of the apprentice attribute.

18
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:42,660
Originally, we had more than a dozen superpowers who died, but the seventeen old people were all university professors.

19
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:43,900
There are more than thirty engineers

20
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,820
I am also an expert on gas leakage. Good luck to your base.
